{"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearch.swift#L18","fileName":"AStarSearch.swift"},"roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}],"title":"AStarSearchEvent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"}],"externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths16AStarSearchEventO","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AStarSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Weight"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The source is discovered first, at distance zero, with its estimate: the heuristic’s guess at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its distance to the target (zero for the target itself). Then, while a vertex is open, the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the smallest distance plus estimate is examined (closed). When that is the target the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"search ends there. Otherwise each of its out-edges is examined in turn with the distance it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offers its target, the examined vertex’s distance plus the edge’s weight, and is then relaxed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the offer is smaller than the target’s distance or the target was not yet discovered, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not relaxed. A relaxed edge to an undiscovered vertex is followed by that vertex’s discovery;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one to a closed vertex, which only an inconsistent heuristic allows, by its reopening (the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Boost Graph Library’s black target), after which it is examined again. After its last out-edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the examined vertex is finished. When the target is never reached the search ends once no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex is open."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/astarsearchevent"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/discover(_:distance:estimate:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/edgeNotRelaxed(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/edgeRelaxed(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentatio